      "writtenOn": "2021-01-14T23:15:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this can be a Map\u003cUID, SignalStrengthRequest\u003e. That will limit the number of requests to 1 per phone per caller, which is fine. It will also make lookups easy for unregister() since the call can just check if the IBinder object matches the one in the record.",
