      "writtenOn": "2021-01-15T23:05:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Tried SparseArray\u003cSignalStrengthRequest\u003e which is a map from UID\u003d\u003e SignalStrengthRequest. But this will make one request per caller for all subIds. This need Map\u003cUID, Set/List\u003cSignalStrengthRequest\u003e\u003e which is too complicated for the record management. Maybe a List\u003cSRR\u003e is simple enough.",
      "parentUuid": "62ecb87f_7025fa12",
